ed.\",\n  \"output\": \"{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-1jmmqn\\\",\\\"item\\\":1,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Production entry points implement the scoped deliverable: Plan pair-neutral target projection, checkpoint message authority, inactive tools/instructions, token metadata, and vendor importer strategies\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-1jmmqn\\\",\\\"item\\\":2,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant positive, negative, compatibility, and recovery tests pass with logs attached\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-1jmmqn\\\",\\\"item\\\":3,\\\"text\\\":\\\"README/doctor/capability evidence and specification traceability are updated without unsupported claims\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-1jmmqn\\\",\\\"item\\\":4,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Closed member sets and identities: Projection Plan 1.0.0 and Clone Projected Object Manifest 1.0.0 have exactly their members (reflection-derived member census, every member missing/extra/duplicated/wrong JSON type refused with a literal code) and their ids equal the JCS digest with only the id member omitted, recomputed independently in the test\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-1jmmqn\\\",\\\"item\\\":5,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Structural rules by whole-domain enumeration against an independent oracle: ProjectionTargetOperation dependencies are strictly lower sequences and form a DAG (every small graph up to 5 operations enumerated), ExpectedTargetResource and ProjectedObjectEntry blob/directory nullability branch-exact over the full kind x field-presence grid, every sorted-unique array refused unsorted or duplicated, every length/cardinality bound at edge and edge+1, the closed plan constants (TransactionPlan, ReadBackPlan, ResumeProjectionPlan, RollbackPlan) refused on any other value\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-1jmmqn\\\",\\\"item\\\":6,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gate x entry census with an explicit axis inventory (for unbounded axes a generated range plus a structural argument), isolated kill attribution, importer outcome grid keyed (package, entry, input) with moved classes named, reuse of internal/canonicaljson and the landed internal/clonefidelity types; task_delta scope, no registry edit; planning semantics are out of scope (TASK-260924-3n78rv)\\\"}}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2197,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 550,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
